{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"; Music: a fast C64-style demo tune. Open the file with the TRACKER button to see it.\nTRACK LOAD \"Sound/Tracker/raster_dream.amostrk\"\nTRACK PLAY\n\n;RASTER SPACE 0,1\n\nRASTER CLEAR\nRASTER 1, 0, 0, 480, \"Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Blue, Indigo, Violet, Red\"\n\nRASTER MODE 2,TRUE\nRASTER WRAP 1,TRUE\nRASTER GFXMODE 1,1\n\nFOR I = 2 TO 9\n  RASTER I, 0, Y, 40, \"Blue, White, Blue,\nNEXT I\n\nLOAD \"Graphics/Layer/FlowerMaskWhite.png\"\nFONT LOAD 0, \"Graphics/font.png\", 32, 25\nFONT MAP 0, \"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ!?:;0123456789@()\u00a3$%.\u2019[]\u201d,-\"\nFONT ZOOM 0,200,200\nFONT PRINT #0,0, 0, 134, \"HELLO AMOS\"\n\nRASTER INFO\n\nY = 0\nY2=0\nMainLoop:\n  INC Y\n  IF Y=360 THEN Y=0\n  FOR I = 2 TO 9\n    RASTER MOVE I, SIN(Y+I*10)*220+220\n  NEXT I  \n\n  RASTER MOVE 1,Y2\n  DEC Y2\n  IF Y2=-480 THEN Y2=0\nWAIT VBL\nGOTO MainLoop"}